37-14-322. Inspections.
Inspections for compliance with the provisions of this chapter may be performed by:
(1) the board of radiologic technologists;
(2) the department of labor and industry;
(3) the department of public health and human services.
History: En. 66-3711 by Sec. 12, Ch. 336, L. 1975; R.C.M. 1947, 66-3711; amd. Sec. 3, Ch. 274, L. 1981; amd. Sec. 61, Ch. 418, L. 1995; amd. Sec. 90, Ch. 546, L. 1995; amd. Sec. 123, Ch. 483, L. 2001.
